<title>UK: German inland gas oil advances in modest volume.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil advances in modest volume.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.8188)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     35.90/36.30     19.74/19.96   35.70/36.10</p>
<p> BREMEN		35.90/36.30     19.74/19.96   35.70/36.10</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    36.00/36.40     19.79/20.01   35.80/36.20</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   36.60/37.00     20.12/20.34   36.40/36.80</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   36.70/37.10     20.18/20.40   36.50/36.90</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  37.60/38.00     20.67/20.89   37.40/37.80</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices were raised again by around 20 pfennigs, reflecting a healthier IPE screen late on Thursday. Demand was patchy. The dollar was off its lows against the mark in thin hedge fund trade. -- London newsroom, +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
